Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:50:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: hook 0111 visible wild Pokemon v2 (6 at once, shadow,
 notice mark, ones you ran from stay)

0110_wildvis.py now keeps its code between SS3DS-WILD-BEGIN/END markers and refreshes it on every build, upgrading a tree hooked by the first 0110 script (same call sites). Up to 6 at once; soft ground shadow on land; a '!' over one that notices you; encounter.c sub_02050724 publishes each battle's winFlag (P3DS_WildBattleResult) so a visible one stays hidden during its battle and remains when the player ran (removed when won/caught); a Repel-blocked one stays too.
